  "title": "Chef John&#39;s Brunswick Stew",
  "description": "Chef John&#39;s take on a Southern classic stew featuring pork, chicken thighs, and veggies. This comforting dish is hearty and meaty with a rich flavor profile.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
  "date_published": "2023-01-13T09:00:00-05:00",
  "date_modified": "2024-12-05T17:14:03-05:00",
